## Grouping Considerations

Some features are too small for their own episode. Possible bundles:

- **Skills + Context + MCP + Commands** → one "equip your agents" episode
- **Terminal splits + groups + search + screenshot + inject + loop** → one "terminal mastery" episode
- **Subtasks + Assets + Templates + Blockers** → one "organize your work" episode
- **Snooze + Due dates + Filters + Kanban customization** → one "manage at scale" episode
- **Linear + GitHub + Jira** → one "integrations" episode
- **Zen + Explode + Tabs + Search + Shortcuts** → one "navigation & speed" episode
- **Analytics + Leaderboard + History + Diagnostics** → one "insights" episode
- **Automations + CLI** → one "automate everything" episode
- **Settings + Themes + Tints + Backups** → montage or weave into other episodes

